THE CLUB BOT — RAILWAY

1. Upload:
   index.js
   deploy-commands.js
   config.js
   package.json

2. Railway Variables:
   TOKEN=your_discord_bot_token

3. Railway Volume:
   /app/data

4. Start Command:
   npm run deploy && npm start

5. Discord Developer Portal:
   Enable:
   - SERVER MEMBERS INTENT
   - MESSAGE CONTENT INTENT

6. Bot permissions recommended:
   - View Channels
   - Send Messages
   - Embed Links
   - Attach Files
   - Read Message History
   - Manage Channels
   - Manage Messages


THE CLUB CASINO

Virtual XP only. No real-money deposits, purchases or cashout.

Commands:
!xp / !balance
!daily
!coinflip <xp> <heads/tails>
!dice <xp> <1-6>
!slots <xp>
!roulette <xp> <red/black/green>
!blackjack <xp> / !bj <xp>
!leaderboard / !lb
!casino

XP data is stored at:
/app/data/xp.json

Keep the Railway Volume mounted at:
/app/data
